    "name": "SN\u00d8: Ultimate Freeriding",
    "steam_appid": 2943150,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SN\u00d8 is a simple game about downhill skiing. Carve your way down procedurally generated mountainscapes and try to score as many points as possible by pulling off high-risk proximity maneuvers and tricks. Mastering the controls and terrain is key to achieving high scores, making every run a test of skill and flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943150/extras/62080411cbe85c7127947b9bdbed6172.poster.avif?t=1755163795\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943150/extras/62080411cbe85c7127947b9bdbed6172.webm?t=1755163795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943150/extras/62080411cbe85c7127947b9bdbed6172.mp4?t=1755163795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SN\u00d8 offers endless procedural mountains to explore. Choose whether you want to chase the top spots on the leaderboards, or just enjoy the ride in Zen mode.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Message from the creators:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SN\u00d8 is made in Norway by two people. We designed it to capture the essence of downhill skiing in a minimalistic and playful way.\u00a0SN\u00d8 is perfect for short gameplay sessions, focusing on rewarding gameplay systems, instant action and smooth controls. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special message to all Steamdeck users:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have optimized SN\u00d8 for the Steamdeck. The game runs at 60-90 FPS on High quality settings. Enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Things you will find in this game</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast and smooth freeriding gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless procedurally generated mountains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three ride styles: Skis, Snowboard and Sit-ski</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless skins requiring skill to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share and revisit mountains by seed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full keyboard and gamepad support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional Zen-mode - No scoring, just you and the mountain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online global and friends leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit top scoring mountains directly from the leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person, third person and drone camera modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photo mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Things you will not find</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepped slopes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loading times</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SN\u00d8 is a simple game about downhill skiing. Carve your way down procedurally generated mountainscapes and try to score as many points as possible by pulling off high-risk proximity maneuvers and tricks. Mastering the controls and terrain is key to achieving high scores, making every run a test of skill and flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943150/extras/62080411cbe85c7127947b9bdbed6172.poster.avif?t=1755163795\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943150/extras/62080411cbe85c7127947b9bdbed6172.webm?t=1755163795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943150/extras/62080411cbe85c7127947b9bdbed6172.mp4?t=1755163795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SN\u00d8 offers endless procedural mountains to explore. Choose whether you want to chase the top spots on the leaderboards, or just enjoy the ride in Zen mode.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Message from the creators:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SN\u00d8 is made in Norway by two people. We designed it to capture the essence of downhill skiing in a minimalistic and playful way.\u00a0SN\u00d8 is perfect for short gameplay sessions, focusing on rewarding gameplay systems, instant action and smooth controls. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special message to all Steamdeck users:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have optimized SN\u00d8 for the Steamdeck. The game runs at 60-90 FPS on High quality settings. Enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Things you will find in this game</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast and smooth freeriding gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless procedurally generated mountains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three ride styles: Skis, Snowboard and Sit-ski</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless skins requiring skill to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share and revisit mountains by seed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full keyboard and gamepad support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional Zen-mode - No scoring, just you and the mountain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online global and friends leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit top scoring mountains directly from the leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person, third person and drone camera modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photo mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Things you will not find</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepped slopes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loading times</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "SN\u00d8 is a minimalistic freeriding game. Push your limits for the high score, or simply enjoy the unforgiving procedural wilderness.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Norwegian<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Finnish<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Greek<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cI keep finding myself coming back to this one. That largely comes down to the fact that it nails the exhilarating feeling of careening down a mountain.\u201d<br>Razbuten<br><br>\u201cBest endless game I've played, high skill cap, easy to get into, and relaxing\u201d<br>Idiom<br><br>\u201cThis is the most fun I've had with a sports related game in a long time. This game has slowly become my go-to comfort game, with the ability to be extremely intense, or easily relaxing.\u201d<br>BitTripBoy<br>",
